Subject: [PATCH 3/9] auth: validate proxy authentication inputs and transports

Preserve the deployed forward-auth flow and shared Authentik transport
helper. Reject ambiguous scoped-mTLS combinations and invalid outpost
namespaces. Carry the related authentication regression cases.
